potion-base-2M.bin — provenance and license
===========================================

This artifact is an int8-quantized conversion (see distill.py in this
directory) of the static embedding matrix and WordPiece vocabulary of:

  Model:    minishlab/potion-base-2M
  Source:   https://huggingface.co/minishlab/potion-base-2M
  Authors:  The Minish Lab (MinishLab)
  License:  MIT, as declared by the model card's front matter
            (`license: mit`) at the time of download (2026-08-07).
  Files:    model.safetensors (29528 x 64 f32), tokenizer.json

potion-base-2M is a Model2Vec model pre-trained with Tokenlearn, distilled
from the baai/bge-base-en-v1.5 sentence transformer.

Conversion: per-token int8 quantization (scale = max|x| / 127), mean per-row
cosine similarity against the f32 original 0.99998 (worst row 0.99992).
Total artifact size: 2,257,134 bytes.

The MIT license permits use, copy, modification, and redistribution of the
model weights, provided this notice is retained.
